flowchart LR
 Breakfast[Breakfast together] --> Play[Mama and children play]
 Play --> Rabbit[Rabbit invites leaf boats]
 Rabbit --> Water[One bucket first]
 Water --> Fork[Paths separate]
 Fork --> Spring[Fill bucket and float boats]
 Fork --> Dog[Papa trains Scooby]
 Spring --> Home[Return home]
 Dog --> Home
 Home --> HugeDog[Dog enters and fills the room]
 HugeDog --> Bath[PinPin carries water to bath]
 Bath --> Shortcut[Magic shortcut]
 Shortcut --> Overflow[Water will not stop]
 Overflow --> Family[Family splash and tea]
 Family --> Plan[Papa proposes Beaver's channel]
 Plan --> Visit[Worksite and collaborative prototype]
 Visit --> Test[Test open-ended sections]
 Test --> Build[Build and bring them home]
 Build --> Canal[Persistent channel to garden]
 Canal --> Spells[Funny attempts and family responses]
 Spells --> Observe[Observe and reverse the sign]
 Observe --> Lake[Remove channel and free ducks]
